                "required": true,
                "default": "📊 **Upload Status**\n\nTo add documents:\n1. Copy files to: `uploads/documents/`\n2. System auto-processes them\n3. Files are vectorized and stored\n4. Ask questions in the chat!\n\n**Supported formats:** PDF, DOCX, TXT, MD, HTML, CSV, and code files\n\n**Current Status:** {status_message}"
              }
            },
            "description": "Shows upload instructions and status"
          }
        }
